    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>武器（鞭），珍稀</em></p><p>你用这把魔法鞭子发动的攻击检定与其伤害掷骰具有+1加值。当你用这把武器命中生物或是物件时，若目标的体型不超过大型，你就能作为攻击伤害的代替，将那个生物或物件向你拉近5尺。</p><p>You gain a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this magic whip. When you hit a creature or object that is Large or smaller with this whip, you can pull that creature or object 5 feet toward you instead of dealing damage.</p>",
